Concrete execution is clean, including all four base cases and several loop cases. The first invariant proof exposed a K proof-shape issue—the backend is not stepping the loop from the overly generic continuation pattern—so I’m narrowing that claim and testing the smallest loop reachability form before reconnecting it to the full function proof.
