codex
The recursive summary was indeed causing unbounded symbolic unfolding, so I replaced it with the direct Fib4 loop invariant: `a,b,c,d` represent four consecutive sequence terms, and one iteration uses the recurrence once. This removes recursive proof-time evaluation; the current run is checking that induction and its finite base-index cases.
